## Important Distinction

This document describes **running a neural network ON hashing silicon** — designing model architectures around operations that hashing ASICs perform natively.

This is different from **LLMs using ASICs as tools** (see [concepts/llm-asic-tool-use.md](../concepts/llm-asic-tool-use.md)), which uses standard model architectures with hardware tool calls.

Both concepts are worth pursuing. They are complementary not competing.

```
Hash-native architecture  → long horizon, new model design
LLM + ASIC tool use       → achievable now, existing models
```

